Hypothesis MW : mw_ok mr.
Hypothesis SCg : m_sizeclass mr = j.
Hypothesis STR : stride = UNIT * size_class j.
Hypothesis SO : slot_ok st g b r idx N.
Hypothesis TK : ltac2:(zQ "10!hs7@1$0?2st").

